### 交易服务通过 Feign 查询商品信息
GET http://localhost:8082/internal/remote-products/1

### 第一次扣减 2 件
POST http://localhost:8082/internal/remote-products/1/stock/deduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "order-demo-20261028-001",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 使用相同 requestId 重试
POST http://localhost:8082/internal/remote-products/1/stock/deduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "order-demo-20261028-001",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 取消订单时恢复 2 件库存
POST http://localhost:8082/internal/remote-products/1/stock/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "order-demo-20261028-001:restore",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 重复恢复同一笔库存操作
POST http://localhost:8082/internal/remote-products/1/stock/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "order-demo-20261028-001:restore",
  "quantity": 2
}